1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:01,680
Matthew 7

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:05,960
Judge not, that you be not judged.

3
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:09,900
For with the judgment you pronounce you will be judged,

4
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:13,040
and with the measure you use it will be measured to you.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,960
Why do you see the speck that is in your brother's eye,

6
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:20,020
but do not notice the log that is in your own eye?

7
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,420
Or how can you say to your brother,

8
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:25,140
Let me take the speck out of your eye,

9
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,680
when there is the log in your own eye?

10
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,120
You hypocrite!

11
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,940
First take the log out of your own eye,

12
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,820
and then you will see clearly

13
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:36,500
to take the speck out of your brother's eye.

14
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,740
Do not give dogs what is holy,

15
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:42,620
and do not throw your pearls before pigs,

16
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:46,620
lest they trample them underfoot and turn to attack you.

17
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,400
Ask, and it will be given to you.

18
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,080
Seek, and you will find.

19
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,360
Knock, and it will be opened to you.

20
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,900
For everyone who asks receives,

21
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,140
and the one who seeks finds.

22
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:01,500
And to the one who knocks, it will be opened.

23
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:06,180
Or which one of you, if his son asks him for bread,

24
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:07,520
will give him a stone?

25
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:10,900
Or if he asks for a fish, will give him a serpent?

26
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:13,640
If you then, who are evil,

27
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:16,040
know how to give good gifts to your children,

28
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:19,120
how much more will your Father who is in heaven

29
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:21,660
give good things to those who ask Him?

30
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:24,700
So whatever you wish that others would do to you,

31
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:26,380
do also to them.

32
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:28,120
For this is the law,

33
00:01:28,140 --> 00:01:29,060
the law and the prophets.

34
00:01:30,580 --> 00:01:32,280
Enter by the narrow gate,

35
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:33,880
for the gate is wide,

36
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:36,160
and the way is easy that leads to destruction,

37
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,820
and those who enter by it are many.

38
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:40,880
For the gate is narrow,

39
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:43,220
and the way is hard that leads to life,

40
00:01:43,540 --> 00:01:45,320
and those who find it are few.

41
00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:47,540
Beware of false prophets,

42
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:49,580
who come to you in sheep's clothing,

43
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:51,960
but inwardly are ravenous wolves.

44
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:54,660
You will recognize them by their fruits.

45
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:57,060
Are grapes gathered from thorn bushes,

46
00:01:57,060 --> 00:01:58,020
or figs from the tree,

47
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:59,300
or figs from thistles?

48
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:02,020
So every healthy tree bears good fruit,

49
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:04,680
but the diseased tree bears bad fruit.

50
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:07,180
A healthy tree cannot bear bad fruit,

51
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,660
nor can a diseased tree bear good fruit.

52
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:13,060
Every tree that does not bear good fruit

53
00:02:13,060 --> 00:02:15,240
is cut down and thrown into the fire.

54
00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:19,600
Thus you will recognize them by their fruits.

55
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:22,820
Not everyone who says to me,

56
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:24,000
Lord, Lord,

57
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:25,940
will enter the kingdom of heaven,

58
00:02:25,940 --> 00:02:28,000
but the one who does the will

59
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,640
of my Father who is in heaven.

60
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:33,040
On that day many will say to me,

61
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:36,320
Lord, Lord, did we not prophesy in your name,

62
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:38,740
and cast out demons in your name,

63
00:02:38,820 --> 00:02:41,380
and do many mighty works in your name?

64
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:43,700
And then will I declare to them,

65
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,640
I never knew you.

66
00:02:46,020 --> 00:02:48,400
Depart from me, you workers of lawlessness.

67
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,980
Everyone then who hears these words of mine

68
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:55,500
and does them will be like a wise man

69
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:57,560
who built his house on the rock,

70
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,060
and the rain fell,

71
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:00,420
and the floods came,

72
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:02,820
and the winds blew and beat on that house,

73
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:04,700
but it did not fall,

74
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:07,400
because it had been founded on the rock.

75
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:10,460
And everyone who hears these words of mine

76
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:11,860
and does not do them

77
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:13,500
will be like a foolish man

78
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:15,900
who built his house on the sand,

79
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:17,400
and the rain fell,

80
00:03:17,540 --> 00:03:18,440
and the floods came,

81
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:19,400
and the winds blew,

82
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:21,260
and beat against that house,

83
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,420
and it fell,

84
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,700
and great was the fall of it.

85
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:27,820
And when Jesus finished these sayings,

86
00:03:27,820 --> 00:03:29,900
the crowds were astonished at his teaching,

87
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:31,220
for he was teaching them

88
00:03:31,220 --> 00:03:33,480
as one who had authority

89
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,740
and not as their scribes.

